<title>INDIA: IDBI Mutual money market fund NAV at 10.16 rupees.</title>
<headline>IDBI Mutual money market fund NAV at 10.16 rupees.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>IDBI Mutual Fund's money market scheme 'Call I-Nit'97's net asset value (NAV) as on July 21, 199,7 was 10.156 rupees, the fund said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The scheme is open for resale on a daily basis at NAV plus a load of 0.1 percent of NAV,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>IDBI Mutual Fund is promoted by IDBI Investment Management Company Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22 265 9000</p>
